Z||000002||Patrick86GT||09-06-2001||05:33 PM||||TX, Eric, I really appreciate your help on this.<P>However, there is some real confusion going on in this particular EGR solonoid. i bought a #14089438 solenoid and it not the correct part..doesn't match any of my four 86 thru 88 GT's (which are all the same, of course)<P>through a Delco outlet, i found the correct # to be Delco 10038324 and picked it up today...a perfect match for the original<P>do you suppose that there is an error in some "master list" somewhere in the parts chain? according to the Delco info, 10038324 is the correct part for all Fiero 2.8's 85 thru 88 and that's what fits on all of mine<P>BTW, it cost me $83.15.  it would be nice to know if these solenoids can be "rebuilt" or repaired.<P>Thanks again<P>Pat<BR>||||reg||1
